  "summary": "I have a combined 8-9 years of professional experience as a software engineer/developer. My experience has been more or less split between desktop application development using a combination of C/C++ and C# with some SQL development through Microsoft SQL Server. I also have experience with web development exercising a RESTful web API, developed with the .NET framework and a couple of javascript frameworks (AngularJS, jQuery, ExtJS).\n\nI have experience outside of development as well. I am familiar with development management and version control through DI2E/JIRA and Subversion respectively, and I have supported my current employer's (Ternion) efforts with application deployment, integration and testing.\n\nI developed from scratch a rest service that allowed one of our customers to insert data into our application at runtime that was previously only available through the application directly. This comprised of a restful web interface that consumed JSON data and translated it into something our native application could understand. I also created for the same customer a service that would serve updated information packets across an AMQP topic automatically as certain components of our native application were updated.\n\nI feel like I have a strong suit for workplace organization. I like to see that the work that I am doing and that my fellow teammates are doing is clearly laid out and well-structured so that anyone in our team can see what anyone else is working on at any given point, and further able to communicate with customers what work is being done and nearing completion. I believe these skills laid out here will be of great use to any career situated within the software development umbrella.",
